    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "JB Kelly is delighted to present No. 45 Glencarraig, a spacious four-bedroom semi-detached family home in one of Sutton’s most established and sought-after residential developments. Positioned within easy walking distance of Sutton Cross, local schools, the DART and the coast, the property offers an excellent combination of space, convenience and a mature family-friendly setting.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is generously proportioned throughout. A porch leads to the inner hallway and a large family living room, while the kitchen/breakfast room provides a practical everyday dining space. The original garage has been converted to create an additional reception room, currently suitable for use as a playroom, home office or family room. Upstairs, there are four bedrooms (3 doubles and 1 single) together with a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nGlencarraig was developed in the 1970s and is characterised by spacious four-bedroom semi-detached homes arranged around two large open greens. The generous layout of the development, together with its established surroundings and extensive communal green space, has made it particularly popular with growing families.\r\n\r\nThe location is one of the property’s strongest features. Sutton Cross is just a short walk away and provides a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday services. There is also an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools, sports clubs and recreational facilities nearby. Sutton DART Station and regular bus services provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre, while Sutton Creek, the seafront and Burrow Beach are all within easy walking distance.\r\n\r\nFor buyers seeking a substantial family home in a mature Sutton location with schools, transport, shopping and coastal amenities close at hand, No. 45 Glencarraig is well worth viewing.\r\n\r\nContact JB Kelly on 01 839 3400 to arrange an appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground floor\r\n\r\nPorch \r\n1.90 x 1.60m\r\nGlazed doors and tiled floor.\r\n\r\nInner Hall \r\n5.00 x 2.15m\r\nSpacious hall with understairs storage.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\nTiled walls and floors, WC & WHB\r\n\r\nFamily Living Room\r\n8.85 x 4.10m\r\nSpacious living area extending from front to rear. Feature fireplace with marble hearth and surround.\r\nFrench doors to large rear garden.\r\n\r\nKitchen Dining Room\r\n3.75 x 4.85m\r\nRange of floor and wall mounted presses. Oven, hob with extractor over, dishwasher, fridge freezer.\r\nDoor through to…\r\n\r\nUtility Space\r\n0.85 x 2.35m\r\nGas boiler, side door to covered gated side entrance.\r\n\r\nPlayroom \r\n5.20 x 2.45m\r\nGarage conversion – also suitable for use as a 5th bedroom or home office\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nLarge spacious landing with access to attic space and hot press.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n4.25 x 3.90m\r\nLarge double bedroom overlooking front garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n2.90 x 3.10m\r\nDouble bedroom overlooking rear garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n4.60 x 3.90m\r\nLarge double room with built-in wardrobes, overlooking front garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\n2.95 x 2.40m\r\nSingle bedroom overlooking the front garden.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.30 x 1.90m\r\nTiled walls and floors, WC and wash hand basin, cubicle shower over.\r\n.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\n\r\nLarge garden to the front with off street parking for multiple cars. Gated side entrance to the rear garden. Large private, rear garden with patio area, mature planting and trees. Block built storage shed."
      },
